# Realtime Auction Arena - SSR browser client.
#
# A separate SemanticScript webServer (port 18090) that server-renders the
# bidder Lobby + Floor. It is a proper decoupled client: it talks to the API
# server (:18083) over HTTP using the new standard.http outbound client
# (clientGet/clientPost) - it logs in once (cached bearer token), fetches the
# auction snapshot, parses the JSON with standard.json, and composes
# standard.html templates into the response. A thin assets/floor.js refreshes
# the live regions between loads.

module app.realtime_auction_arena.client
purpose module app.realtime_auction_arena.client "Server-rendered bidder Lobby + Floor for the Realtime Auction Arena, fetching state from the API over standard.http and composing standard.html templates."
moduleOwns app.realtime_auction_arena.client "webServer + route table, the cached API bearer-token login, static asset + health handlers, and the Lobby/Floor/404 page templates and handlers that fetch + parse + render."
moduleDoesNotOwn app.realtime_auction_arena.client "Auction rules, writes, or auth issuance (owned by the API server). HTML fragment components live in app.realtime_auction_arena.client.components."
invariant module app.realtime_auction_arena.client "This client never owns auction state; it fetches over HTTP and renders. Dynamic text flows through escaped String template holes; heap-owned fetch buffers are freed via defer."
moduleWarning app.realtime_auction_arena.client "One cached bearer token shared across requests; safe under the blocking HTTP/1.1 backend (one request at a time). On token expiry the floor degrades to 'unavailable' until process restart (re-login-on-401 is a follow-up)."

import http standard.http
import html standard.html
import json standard.json
import components app.realtime_auction_arena.client.components

webServer realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer
purpose operation realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer "Host the Realtime Auction Arena SSR bidder client on localhost:18090."
serverHost realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer "127.0.0.1"
serverPort realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer 18090
route realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer GET "/" lobbyPageHandler
route realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer GET "/floor/:auctionId" floorPageHandler
route realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer GET "/assets/:filename" staticAssetHandler
route realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer GET "/health" healthHandler
route realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer GET "/probe-api" probeApiHandler
route realtimeAuctionArenaClientServer GET "*" notFoundPageHandler

capability filesystemReadCapability filesystem read
purpose operation filesystemReadCapability "Authority to read files from the assets directory for static response serving."
capability jsonDocumentReadCapability json.document.tree read
purpose operation jsonDocumentReadCapability "Authority to parse and read JSON fetched from the API server."
capability heapAllocCapability heap allocate
purpose operation heapAllocCapability "Authority to allocate scratch buffers for JSON string reads."
capability heapFreeCapability heap free
purpose operation heapFreeCapability "Authority to free JSON scratch + fetched response buffers."

